# Discontinuous and non-smooth targets.
approx sign(x) in -1..1 degree 5 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx (x>0?1:0) in -1..1 degree 5 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx floor(x) in 0..1 degree 5 as f32 list 1
approx abs(x) in -1..1 degree 4 as f32 list 1
approx sqrt(x) in -1..1 degree 4 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
